spice
* SPICE netlist for the given schematic

*.model statements for the MOSFETs (example: LEVEL=1, here assumed)
.model NMOS NMOS LEVEL=1
.model PMOS PMOS LEVEL=1

* NMOS Transistor
M1 3 7 8 8 NMOS

* PMOS Transistor
M2 4 2 5 5 PMOS

* Current Source I
I1 5 4 DC I

* Current Source 2I
I2 8 6 DC 2I

* Voltage Source VDD
VDD 5 0 DC VDD

* Voltage Source VSS
VSS 6 0 DC -VSS

* Input node for reference
Vin 7 0 DC Vi
